{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-rag-patterns","title":"模式谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/foundations/graph-rag-patterns","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"模式谱系\">模式谱系</h1><p>「我们上 GraphRAG 吧」这句话在 2026 年已经近乎没有信息量——因为 GraphRAG 不是一个系统，而是一整族取舍各异的方案。Microsoft 2024 年放出的原始 GraphRAG 把一切都在索引时算满，质量高但贵到劝退；随后两年里 LazyGraphRAG、LightRAG、HippoRAG、Fast GraphRAG、NodeRAG 等一批方案接连出现，核心都在回答同一个问题的不同答案：<strong>索引时算多少、查询时算多少。</strong> 把这条主轴画出来，整个谱系就立住了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>读懂整个谱系，只需要抓住一个变量和几个术语：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主轴：索引成本 vs 查询成本</strong>。所有方案都在做同一笔交易——把工作量在「离线索引」和「在线查询」之间分配。算得越早越快越稳但前期越重、越难应对更新；算得越晚越便宜灵活但每次查询越贵。</li>\n<li><strong>总成本公式</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Total</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Total} = C_{\\text{index}} + N_{\\text{query}} \\cdot C_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：查询量大时把成本压进索引摊薄（原始 GraphRAG），语料常变或查询量不定时压低索引容忍高查询成本（LazyGraphRAG）。</li>\n<li><strong>重量级锚点</strong>：Microsoft GraphRAG，四步索引（抽取→建图→Leiden 社区→摘要）+ 三种查询（Local / Global / DRIFT），质量高但索引贵到 $33k 量级。</li>\n<li><strong>轻量流派</strong>：LazyGraphRAG（延迟摘要，索引至 0.1%）、LightRAG（双层检索，索引约 1/6000、支持增量）、HippoRAG（PPR 把多跳压成一跳）、Fast GraphRAG / NodeRAG / PathRAG（分别在建图速度、异构节点、路径剪枝上优化）。</li>\n<li><strong>没有通用最优</strong>：只有「对你的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和更新频率最优」。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;索引时算满&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Microsoft GraphRAG&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;LightRAG 建图不摘要&quot;]&#10;  D[&quot;查询时再算&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;LazyGraphRAG 延迟摘要&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;HippoRAG 一次 PPR&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; G[&quot;查询快 · 索引最贵&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;索引最省 · 查询较贵&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"索引时算满\"] --&gt; B[\"Microsoft GraphRAG\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"LightRAG 建图不摘要\"]\n  D[\"查询时再算\"] --&gt; E[\"LazyGraphRAG 延迟摘要\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"HippoRAG 一次 PPR\"]\n  B --&gt; G[\"查询快 · 索引最贵\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"索引最省 · 查询较贵\"]</pre><h2 id=\"一条主轴-索引成本-vs-查询成本\">一条主轴：索引成本 vs 查询成本</h2><p>所有图谱 RAG 方案都在做同一笔交易——把工作量在「离线索引」和「在线查询」之间分配。算得越早（索引时），查询越快越稳，但前期投入越重、越难应对语料更新；算得越晚（查询时），索引越便宜越灵活，但每次查询越贵越慢。原始 GraphRAG 站在「索引时算满」的极端，向量 RAG 站在「几乎不预算」的另一端，新流派则是在中间找更划算的点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Total Cost</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>一次性</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>每次</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Total Cost} = \\underbrace{C_{\\text{index}}}_{\\text{一次性}} + N_{\\text{query}} \\cdot \\underbrace{C_{\\text{query}}}_{\\text{每次}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">一次性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">每次</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个简单的式子解释了一切流派之争：当查询量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很大时，把成本压进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{index}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 摊薄更划算（原始 GraphRAG 思路）；当语料频繁变、查询量不确定时，压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{index}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、容忍较高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更稳（LazyGraphRAG 思路）。没有放之四海皆准的最优，只有「对你的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和更新频率最优」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ROOT[图谱 RAG 选型] --&gt; AX{索引时算满&lt;br/&gt;还是查询时再算?}&#10;  AX --&gt;|索引时算满&lt;br/&gt;查询快质量高| MS[Microsoft GraphRAG&lt;br/&gt;实体+关系+社区+摘要全预算]&#10;  AX --&gt;|索引时极简&lt;br/&gt;查询时现算| LAZY[LazyGraphRAG&lt;br/&gt;延迟摘要到查询时]&#10;  AX --&gt;|索引时建图但不摘要&lt;br/&gt;双层检索| LIGHT[LightRAG&lt;br/&gt;local+global 双层]&#10;  AX --&gt;|个性化 PageRank&lt;br/&gt;类海马体记忆| HIPPO[HippoRAG&lt;br/&gt;PPR 一跳出多跳]&#10;  MS --&gt; NEED1[大语料·查询量大·全局问题多]&#10;  LAZY --&gt; NEED2[预算敏感·语料会变]&#10;  LIGHT --&gt; NEED3[要增量更新·成本低]&#10;  HIPPO --&gt; NEED4[多跳为主·索引轻]\">flowchart TD\n  ROOT[图谱 RAG 选型] --&gt; AX{索引时算满&lt;br/&gt;还是查询时再算?}\n  AX --&gt;|索引时算满&lt;br/&gt;查询快质量高| MS[Microsoft GraphRAG&lt;br/&gt;实体+关系+社区+摘要全预算]\n  AX --&gt;|索引时极简&lt;br/&gt;查询时现算| LAZY[LazyGraphRAG&lt;br/&gt;延迟摘要到查询时]\n  AX --&gt;|索引时建图但不摘要&lt;br/&gt;双层检索| LIGHT[LightRAG&lt;br/&gt;local+global 双层]\n  AX --&gt;|个性化 PageRank&lt;br/&gt;类海马体记忆| HIPPO[HippoRAG&lt;br/&gt;PPR 一跳出多跳]\n  MS --&gt; NEED1[大语料·查询量大·全局问题多]\n  LAZY --&gt; NEED2[预算敏感·语料会变]\n  LIGHT --&gt; NEED3[要增量更新·成本低]\n  HIPPO --&gt; NEED4[多跳为主·索引轻]</pre><h2 id=\"重量级一端-microsoft-graphrag\">重量级一端：Microsoft GraphRAG</h2><p>原始 GraphRAG 是把「质量」摆第一的参考实现，也是理解整个领域的基准坐标系。它的索引管线完整跑四步：LLM 抽实体与关系 → 组装全局图 → Leiden 社区检测 → 为每个社区层级生成摘要报告。查询时提供三种模式：<strong>Local Search</strong>（围绕具体实体的局部检索）、<strong>Global Search</strong>（聚合社区摘要回答全局问题）、<strong>DRIFT Search</strong>（Dynamic Reasoning and Inference with Flexible Traversal，2026 年加入，兼顾广度与深度，把全局与局部联动起来）。</p>\n<p>它的问题只有一个字：贵。索引一份大型企业语料的报道成本常在 <strong>$33,000 量级</strong>，因为社区摘要这一步要对图的每一层、每个社区都调用 LLM 生成一遍报告。这正是后续所有轻量流派要解决的痛点。它的四步管线分别由本 hub 的 <a href=\"../construction/entity-extraction\">实体与关系抽取</a>、<a href=\"../construction/graph-construction\">图谱构建</a>、<a href=\"../construction/community-detection\">社区检测与摘要</a> 三篇详解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轻量化一端-把成本砍掉两三个数量级\">轻量化一端：把成本砍掉两三个数量级</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>LazyGraphRAG</strong>：核心招数是「把社区摘要推迟到查询时」。索引时只建图、不预生成摘要，于是索引成本降到原始 GraphRAG 的 <strong>0.1%（与向量 RAG 同量级）</strong>；查询全局问题时再现场对相关子图做摘要，据报全局查询成本可低至原方案的 <strong>1/700</strong>，而局部、全局质量都不落下风。代价是单次全局查询变慢、变贵——典型的「成本后移」。</li>\n<li><strong>LightRAG</strong>：不预算社区摘要，改用<strong>双层检索（dual-level retrieval）</strong>——查询时让 LLM 同时抽出「高层主题关键词」和「低层实体关键词」，分别走全局与局部两路在图上召回。它把索引 token 成本砍到约原方案的 <strong>1/6000</strong>，且因为不依赖整体社区结构，<strong>天然支持增量更新</strong>：新文档进来只需局部增补，不必重跑全图。双层检索是 <a href=\"../retrieval/hybrid-graph-vector\">图向量混合</a> 的重点。</li>\n<li><strong>HippoRAG</strong>：受海马体记忆索引启发，把多跳检索压成「一次个性化 PageRank（PPR）」——在图上从查询实体撒概率、一次扩散就拿到多跳邻域，号称以 <strong>10–30 倍更低成本</strong> 达到与社区方案相当的多跳准确率。PPR 机制是 <a href=\"../retrieval/graph-traversal-retrieval\">图遍历检索</a> 的核心。</li>\n<li><strong>Fast GraphRAG / NodeRAG / PathRAG</strong> 等：分别在「更快建图」「异构节点结构」「路径剪枝省 context（PathRAG 报告 context 用量 −44%）」上各做优化，是这条谱系上的细分点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一张选型对照表\">一张选型对照表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流派</th>\n<th>索引成本</th>\n<th>查询成本</th>\n<th>增量更新</th>\n<th>最适问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Microsoft GraphRAG</td>\n<td>极高（$33k 量级）</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>弱（需重跑社区）</td>\n<td>全局概览、大语料、查询量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LazyGraphRAG</td>\n<td>极低（向量量级）</td>\n<td>高（全局现算）</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>预算敏感、语料会变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LightRAG</td>\n<td>很低（约 1/6000）</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>要增量、综合性价比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HippoRAG</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多跳为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量 RAG（对照）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>单段事实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型口诀：<strong>查询量大且语料稳定 → 偏重量级预算；预算紧或语料常变 → 偏轻量化、要增量就看 LightRAG；纯多跳 → HippoRAG。</strong> 而最终是否要图、要哪个，还要叠加 <a href=\"graph-vs-vector-rag\">图与向量 RAG</a> 的问题形状判断和 <a href=\"../practice/graph-rag-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的决策树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GraphRAG 是一族而非一个，所有流派的差异都能归到一条主轴：<strong>索引时算多少 vs 查询时算多少</strong>，由总成本公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{index}} + N_{\\text{query}} \\cdot C_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定取舍。</li>\n<li>重量级一端是 Microsoft GraphRAG：四步索引 + 三种查询（Local/Global/DRIFT），质量高但索引贵到 $33k 量级。</li>\n<li>轻量化一端把成本砍两三个数量级：LazyGraphRAG 延迟摘要（索引降至 0.1%）、LightRAG 双层检索（索引约 1/6000 且支持增量）、HippoRAG 用 PPR 把多跳压成一跳。</li>\n<li>选型按「查询量 × 更新频率」落点，再叠加问题形状与决策树，没有通用最优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"graph-vs-vector-rag\">图与向量 RAG</a> 给出落格判断；四步管线分别见 <a href=\"../construction/entity-extraction\">实体与关系抽取</a>、<a href=\"../construction/community-detection\">社区检测与摘要</a>。</li>\n<li>同 hub：PPR 见 <a href=\"../retrieval/graph-traversal-retrieval\">图遍历检索</a>；双层检索见 <a href=\"../retrieval/hybrid-graph-vector\">图向量混合</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：模块化 RAG 流派对照见 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/rag-architecture/modular-rag\">RAG 知识系统 · 模块化 RAG</a>；智能体式按需检索见 <a href=\"../../agentic-rag/foundations/agentic-rag-patterns\">智能体 RAG · 模式</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模式谱系","id":"模式谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一条主轴：索引成本 vs 查询成本","id":"一条主轴-索引成本-vs-查询成本"},{"level":2,"text":"重量级一端：Microsoft GraphRAG","id":"重量级一端-microsoft-graphrag"},{"level":2,"text":"轻量化一端：把成本砍掉两三个数量级","id":"轻量化一端-把成本砍掉两三个数量级"},{"level":2,"text":"一张选型对照表","id":"一张选型对照表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图与向量 RAG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/foundations/graph-vs-vector-rag"},"next":{"title":"实体与关系抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/construction/entity-extraction"}}